---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | TechPilot AI" description="Read the TechPilot AI privacy policy and learn how site data may be handled.">
  <section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Legal information</span><h1>Privacy <span style="color:var(--mint)">policy.</span></h1><p>Last updated: October 16, 2026</p></section>
  <div class="prose">
    <div class="notice">Important: this is a starter policy for a site under development. It must be reviewed and updated to reflect the services actually enabled, the operator's details, and applicable law before public launch.</div>
    <h2>Information collected</h2><p>TechPilot AI may receive information you choose to send when contacting the site. Hosting providers may also process standard technical data, such as request logs, for security and service operation.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This starter version does not intentionally add analytics or advertising scripts. If analytics, advertising, embedded content, or other third-party services are added, this policy must be updated to explain their data practices and any choices available to visitors.</p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2><p>If advertising services such as Google AdSense are introduced, third-party vendors may use cookies or similar technologies as described by their applicable policies and settings. No advertising service is represented as active on this site at this time.</p>
    <h2>External websites</h2><p>Articles may link to third-party websites. We do not control their content or privacy practices, so please review their policies before sharing information with them.</p>
    <h2>Data retention and your choices</h2><p>Any information sent directly to the site should be retained only as needed for the purpose for which it was provided and applicable obligations. Contact details and a process for privacy requests should be added before launch.</p>
    <h2>Policy updates</h2><p>This policy may be revised when the site changes. The updated date above should be changed whenever a substantive revision is published.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>A dedicated privacy contact will be added before launch.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
